# at index (N) is invalid" a run, GL_INVALID_FRAMEBUFFER_OPERATION by the
# thousand) and draws errors or black where GPU skinning matters. Told 3.0, it
# skins on the CPU and takes its ES 3.0 variants; in a test pass that turned 4
# of 4 GPU-skinning titles into passes. The year comes from the libunity build
# in the process; Unity 2018/2019 still need 3.x, so they keep 3.2. An explicit
# KL_GLES_VERSION (or kl_egl_set_gles_version) still wins.
