# tripper that maps/patches executable pages", but the binary cannot do that:
# across every SDK version in the catalogue (1.97 .. 1.113) it imports no
# mmap, mprotect, mremap or memfd, its only raw syscalls are sched_setaffinity,
# gettid and rt_sigprocmask (all answered by klb_syscall), and its init_array
# is outline-atomics HWCAP detection, CPU-flag statics, a mutex, and the Unity
# effect-parameter registration — no code is generated or rewritten anywhere.
# klepton-ld translates every copy with 0 refused TLS/x18/CTR sites, and the
# older Oculus spatializer built from the same audio engine already runs as a
